 "details": "BalkInvoer ('balk'), VeldInvoer ('veld'), CoordInvoer ('coord') and KlokInvoer ('wijzers') follow the same input-object protocol as terminal/rooster.py: hoogte, knoppen, teken, toets (returns None until the answer is submitted, then (text, number)), hulp, rijen, plus attributes melding, melding_rol, fouten, diagnose, cursor_pos, hint (and optionally naast). Drawing is delegated to terminal/modellen.py (teken_balk, teken_veld, teken_kaart, teken_klok), whose click callbacks create the click actions ('stuk', 'vak', 'rij', 'punt', 'wijzer') that toets handles. The data models (Breukbalk, Wijzerklok, kaart) come from kern/modellen.py. The table INVOER at the bottom is merged into terminal/oefenaar.py's INVOER.",
